    {
      "create_time": 1758299777,
      "formatted_time": "2025-09-20 00:36:17",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "str_content": "大家晚上好~ @所有人 \n\n感谢各位抽出时间参与今天的选拔赛，大家的表现都很精彩，我们也从中感受到了各位对羽毛球的兴趣与热爱[爱心] 但由于场地和人手有限，无法让每位同学都打到尽兴，如有照顾不周还请多多谅解~\n\n出于迎新杯赛制对新生数量的要求，本次选拔还是会以招募25级同学为主。我们会在明后两天私戳选拔上的同学，也希望没有收到通知的同学不要气馁[太阳] 无论是否选上，相信大家都在这个过程中挥洒了汗水、结识了新朋友，体会到了羽球的乐趣！✨\n\n最后，本群之后不会解散，将自动成为25级PHBS约球群。希望大家之后可以多多打球，将这份乐趣变成在汇丰的课业和工作之外的小幸福🥰",
      "is_send": 0,
      "sender_name": "舟渡.",
      "sender_wxid": "wxid_x5p36fmvpfhf12"
    },
    {
      "create_time": 1758299818,
      "formatted_time": "2025-09-20 00:36:58",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "str_content": "Good evening, everyone~  \n\nThank you all for taking the time to join today’s badminton selection trial. Everyone put on a fantastic performance, and we could feel your passion for badminton through it all [Heart]. However, due to limited venue and staff, we couldn’t let everyone play for a long time. We ask for your kind understanding if we fail to make this a perfect experience for you~  \n\nBecause of the competition's requirement on the number of new students, this selection will mainly focus on recruiting students of the Class of 2025. We will send private messages to the selected students within the next two days. For those who don’t receive a notification, please don’t be discouraged [Sun] Whether you’re selected or not, we believe everyone has sweated it out, made new friends, and truly experienced the joy of badminton in this process! ✨  \n\nLastly, this WeChat group will automatically become the PHBS Badminton Group. We hope you’ll keep playing badminton, and turn this joy into a happiness that accompanies you outside of your studies at PHBS! 🥰",
      "is_send": 0,
      "sender_name": "舟渡.",
      "sender_wxid": "wxid_x5p36fmvpfhf12"
    },
